## Skill Usage (MANDATORY)

Skills are **required**, not optional. At each stage, you MUST read and follow the corresponding skill. Do not skip skills. Do not paraphrase from memory — read the SKILL.md file every time.

| Stage | Skill | Path | Trigger |
|-------|-------|------|--------|
| SPEC | spec-driven-development | `~/.agents/skills/spec-driven-development/SKILL.md` | Complex or ambiguous tasks |
| PLAN | planning-and-task-breakdown | `~/.agents/skills/planning-and-task-breakdown/SKILL.md` | Any task with >2 subtasks |
| BUILD | test-driven-development | `~/.agents/skills/test-driven-development/SKILL.md` | **Always** — RED → GREEN → REFACTOR |
| BUILD | incremental-implementation | `~/.agents/skills/incremental-implementation/SKILL.md` | Multi-file changes |
| BUILD | frontend-ui-engineering | `~/.agents/skills/frontend-ui-engineering/SKILL.md` | UI/component work |
